      "description": "#reference headline with the contact beside it, subject below, outline status trigger with swatch.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-hd\"><div><div class=\"ds-l1\"><span class=\"ds-ref\">#1042</span><span class=\"ds-meta\">Dana Levi</span></div><div class=\"ds-subj\">Card declined at vendor</div></div><button class=\"ds-st\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-sw\"></span>On you</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-hd{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;width:480px;padding:8px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E0E6E3;background:#fff;font-family: Urbanist, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;color:#0F1F1A} .ds-l1{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px} .ds-ref{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums} .ds-meta{font-size:12px;color:#54645F} .ds-subj{font-size:14px;font-weight:600} .ds-st{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:4px 10px;border:1px solid #CDD6D1;border-radius:4px;background:#FCFDFC;font-family: Urbanist, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#0F1F1A;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s} .ds-st:hover{background:#EBF1EE} .ds-st:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #41AA5E;outline-offset:2px} .ds-sw{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:1px;background:#E63F19}"
    },
    {
