      "description": "Conversation details: one aligned label column, a hairline per row.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-spec\"><div><span class=\"ds-k\">Inbox</span><span>support@clyr.io</span></div><div><span class=\"ds-k\">Created</span><span>Oct 12, 2026 9:41 AM</span></div><div><span class=\"ds-k\">First reply</span><span>Oct 12, 2026 10:02 AM</span></div></div>",
